{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-science","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 实施科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/implementation-science","wordCount":1969,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-循证医学-实施科学\">研究生 循证医学 — 实施科学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>实施科学（Implementation Science）研究如何将经过验证的循证干预系统地整合到常规临床实践和卫生政策中，弥合&quot;知行差距&quot;（Know-Do Gap）——即已有的最佳证据与实际临床行为之间的巨大鸿沟。研究表明，从发现有效干预到广泛临床应用平均需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span></span></span></span></span> 年，仅约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14%</span></span></span></span></span> 的研究成果最终转化为临床实践。实施科学通过系统化的理论框架、评估方法和干预策略，加速这一转化过程并提高成功率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"实施科学的理论框架\">实施科学的理论框架</h3><p>实施科学领域已发展出超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 种理论、模型和框架。按功能可分为三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>代表性框架</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过程模型</td>\n<td>指导实施过程的步骤</td>\n<td>Knowledge-to-Action (KTA)、PDSA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性框架</td>\n<td>识别影响实施的因素</td>\n<td>CFIR、TDF、Ecological Model</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评价框架</td>\n<td>评价实施的成功程度</td>\n<td>RE-AIM、Proctor 分类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>CFIR（Consolidated Framework for Implementation Research）</strong> 是最广泛使用的确定性框架，将影响实施的因素组织为五个域：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[干预特征] --&gt; F[实施成效]&#10;    B[外部环境] --&gt; F&#10;    C[内部环境] --&gt; F&#10;    D[个体特征] --&gt; F&#10;    E[实施过程] --&gt; F&#10;    &#10;    A --&gt; A1[证据强度]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[相对优势]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[适应性]&#10;    A --&gt; A4[复杂性]&#10;    &#10;    C --&gt; C1[组织文化]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[领导力]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[资源]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[准备度]&#10;    &#10;    D --&gt; D1[知识与信念]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[自我效能]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[变革态度]\">graph TD\n    A[干预特征] --&gt; F[实施成效]\n    B[外部环境] --&gt; F\n    C[内部环境] --&gt; F\n    D[个体特征] --&gt; F\n    E[实施过程] --&gt; F\n    \n    A --&gt; A1[证据强度]\n    A --&gt; A2[相对优势]\n    A --&gt; A3[适应性]\n    A --&gt; A4[复杂性]\n    \n    C --&gt; C1[组织文化]\n    C --&gt; C2[领导力]\n    C --&gt; C3[资源]\n    C --&gt; C4[准备度]\n    \n    D --&gt; D1[知识与信念]\n    D --&gt; D2[自我效能]\n    D --&gt; D3[变革态度]</pre><p><strong>理论域框架</strong>（Theoretical Domains Framework, TDF）从行为科学视角识别实施障碍，将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span></span></span></span></span> 种行为改变理论综合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 个域：知识、技能、社会/专业角色认同、关于能力的信念、关于后果的信念、动机与目标、记忆与决策过程、环境背景与资源、社会影响、情绪、行为调节、乐观主义、意向、强化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实施结局的分类\">实施结局的分类</h3><p>Proctor 等人（2011）建立了实施结局的标准分类法，区分了三个层次的结局：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结局层次</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>测量时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>实施结局</strong></td>\n<td>可接受性、采纳率、适当性、成本、可行性、保真度、渗透率、可持续性</td>\n<td>实施过程中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>服务结局</strong></td>\n<td>效率、安全性、有效性、公平性、以患者为中心、及时性</td>\n<td>实施后短期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>患者结局</strong></td>\n<td>满意度、功能状态、症状学</td>\n<td>实施后长期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键实施结局的定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>保真度</strong>（Fidelity）：干预被实施时与原始方案的一致程度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>实际执行的核心组分数</mtext><mtext>方案规定的核心组分数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fidelity = \\frac{\\text{实际执行的核心组分数}}{\\text{方案规定的核心组分数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">方案规定的核心组分数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">实际执行的核心组分数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>渗透率</strong>（Penetration）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>实际接受干预的合格个体数</mtext><mtext>应接受干预的合格个体数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Penetration = \\frac{\\text{实际接受干预的合格个体数}}{\\text{应接受干预的合格个体数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">应接受干预的合格个体数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">实际接受干预的合格个体数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>可持续性</strong>（Sustainability）：干预在初始实施支持撤除后继续以可接受保真度运行的程度</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实施策略\">实施策略</h3><p>实施策略（Implementation Strategies）是促进循证实践被采纳和维持的具体方法。ERIC（Expert Recommendations for Implementing Change）项目通过德尔菲法确定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>73</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">73</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">73</span></span></span></span></span> 种离散实施策略，归类为九大类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>作用机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>教育培训</td>\n<td>继续医学教育、审计反馈</td>\n<td>提升知识和技能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临床决策支持</td>\n<td>临床路径、CDSS 提醒</td>\n<td>降低行为改变的认知负荷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利益相关者参与</td>\n<td>临床倡导者、患者代表</td>\n<td>增强动机和社会支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组织变革</td>\n<td>流程再造、绩效考核整合</td>\n<td>改变结构性障碍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济激励</td>\n<td>绩效付费、费用减免</td>\n<td>改变成本-收益计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适配与裁剪</td>\n<td>基于障碍评估定制策略</td>\n<td>精准匹配实施需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>审计与反馈</strong>（Audit and Feedback）是研究最充分的实施策略之一。Cochrane 系统综述（Ivers et al., 2012）发现审计反馈的中位效应量为绝对改善 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.3%</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IQR: 0.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">QR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span></span></span></span></span>），效果因以下因素而变化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>效果量</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>基线依从性低</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>反馈频率高</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>个体化</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>可操作性</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{效果量} \\propto f(\\text{基线依从性低}, \\text{反馈频率高}, \\text{个体化}, \\text{可操作性})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">效果量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基线依从性低</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">反馈频率高</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个体化</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可操作性</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"实施科学的研究设计\">实施科学的研究设计</h3><p>实施研究采用与临床试验不同的研究设计：</p>\n<p><strong>阶梯楔形设计</strong>（Stepped Wedge Design）：所有集群（如医院、科室）最终都接受干预，但引入时间随机错开。特别适合：干预被认为有益（伦理上不宜永久不干预）、资源限制无法同时在所有地点实施。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{ij} = \\mu + \\alpha_i + \\beta_j + \\theta X_{ij} + \\epsilon_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为集群随机效应，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为时间固定效应，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为干预暴露指示变量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 为干预效应。</p>\n<p><strong>混合效果-实施设计</strong>（Hybrid Effectiveness-Implementation Design）同时测试临床干预的效果和实施策略的有效性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计类型</th>\n<th>主要目标</th>\n<th>次要目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hybrid I</td>\n<td>测试临床干预效果</td>\n<td>收集实施数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hybrid II</td>\n<td>同时测试临床效果和实施策略</td>\n<td>双重关注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hybrid III</td>\n<td>测试实施策略</td>\n<td>收集临床效果数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"re-aim-评价框架\">RE-AIM 评价框架</h3><p>RE-AIM 框架从五个维度全面评价实施的公共卫生影响：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>公共卫生影响</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{公共卫生影响} = Reach \\times Effectiveness \\times Adoption \\times Implementation \\times Maintenance</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">公共卫生影响</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ess</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ain</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>测量指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>R</strong>each（覆盖）</td>\n<td>目标人群中参与的比例和代表性</td>\n<td>参与率、参与者人口学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>E</strong>ffectiveness（效果）</td>\n<td>对关键结局的影响（含负面效应）</td>\n<td>效应量、亚组效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>A</strong>doption（采纳）</td>\n<td>采纳干预的机构/提供者比例</td>\n<td>采纳率、采纳者特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>I</strong>mplementation（实施）</td>\n<td>干预被按照方案实施的程度</td>\n<td>保真度、成本、适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>M</strong>aintenance（维持）</td>\n<td>个体和组织层面的长期持续</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 个月后的持续率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>选择一项已有强证据支持但在你所在临床环境中实施率较低的循证实践（如脓毒症 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 小时集束化治疗、早期活动干预、术前抗生素预防）。使用 CFIR 框架分析影响实施的五个域的具体障碍和促进因素。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你设计了一项改善急诊科脓毒症识别和治疗的质量改进项目。请使用 Hybrid III 设计框架，明确：(a) 你测试的实施策略，(b) 实施结局指标（至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个 Proctor 指标），(c) 临床效果的辅助评价方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>审计与反馈的效果在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span></span></span></span></span> 之间变异极大。基于行为科学原理（如 TDF 的&quot;关于后果的信念&quot;和&quot;行为调节&quot;域），解释为什么个体化、及时且可操作的反馈比延迟、聚合性的反馈更有效。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某医院成功实施了一项降低中心静脉导管相关血流感染（CLABSI）的集束化干预，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 个月内 CLABSI 率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.2/1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.2/1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 导管日降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8/1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8/1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 导管日。但项目资金在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 个月后结束，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 个月时 CLABSI 率回升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.1/1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.1/1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 导管日。使用 RE-AIM 的 Maintenance 维度分析可能的原因，并提出提高可持续性的策略。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Nilsen, P. (2015)</strong>：&quot;Making Sense of Implementation Theories, Models and Frameworks&quot;，Implementation Science——实施科学理论框架的综合分类</li>\n<li><strong>Damschroder, L.J. et al. (2009)</strong>：&quot;Fostering Implementation of Health Services Research Findings into Practice&quot;，Implementation Science——CFIR 框架的原始论文</li>\n<li><strong>Proctor, E.K. et al. (2011)</strong>：&quot;Outcomes for Implementation Research: Conceptual Distinctions, Measurement Challenges, and a Research Agenda&quot;，Administration and Policy in Mental Health——实施结局分类的权威文献</li>\n<li><strong>Glasgow, R.E. et al. (2019)</strong>：&quot;RE-AIM Planning and Evaluation Framework&quot;，Frontiers in Public Health——RE-AIM 框架的更新与扩展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>实施科学为弥合证据-实践差距提供了系统化的理论基础和方法论工具。CFIR 和 TDF 框架帮助识别多层次的实施障碍，Proctor 分类为实施结局提供了标准化测量体系，ERIC 策略库为干预设计提供了循证选项。阶梯楔形设计和混合效果-实施设计满足了实施研究的独特方法学需求。RE-AIM 框架以乘法模型强调了覆盖面和可持续性与临床效果同等重要——一项无法广泛推广和长期维持的干预，即使效果显著，其公共卫生影响也是有限的。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 循证医学 — 实施科学","id":"研究生-循证医学-实施科学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"实施科学的理论框架","id":"实施科学的理论框架"},{"level":3,"text":"实施结局的分类","id":"实施结局的分类"},{"level":3,"text":"实施策略","id":"实施策略"},{"level":3,"text":"实施科学的研究设计","id":"实施科学的研究设计"},{"level":3,"text":"RE-AIM 评价框架","id":"re-aim-评价框架"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 临床实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/clinical-practice-guidelines"},"next":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 共同决策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/shared-decision-making"}}